  "not_covered": [
    "Axioms whose object is an anonymous class expression are dropped. OWL restrictions, equivalent-class expressions and union domains and ranges are therefore absent, and a reasoner over these extracts derives less than one over the upstream.",
    "These extracts cannot be used to claim the ontology is consistent with Basic Formal Ontology or Common Core Ontologies. They support the subClassOf reachability the shapes ask about.",
    "A `select: named` source carries only the terms this repository names, and their structural ancestry. A new upstream reference in the corpus is not covered until this is rebuilt; tests/test_upstream_vendoring.py fails when that happens.",
    "Specification seeds, when a specification component exists, are read from its text. A term it names that no pinned file describes is recorded, not refused: it may be a term the project will mint, a term from an unvendored file, or a typo. Which is which is not decided here.",
    "owl:imports is not emitted. Validation is offline by design, so nothing resolves over the network at check time."
  ],
